# ==============================================================================
# SMART SOIL — Environment Variables Template
# ==============================================================================
# VERCEL WEB DEPLOYMENT (Server-side only — NEVER prefix with VITE_):
# Add GEMINI_API_KEY in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
# For local web dev (`vercel dev` or `npm run dev`), copy to `.env.local` and set:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_actual_gemini_api_key_here
#
# ANDROID APP:
# Firebase AI Logic is provisioned via app/google-services.json and App Check.
# Keep GEMINI_API_KEY commented out here so Secrets Gradle Plugin does not
# package a placeholder string into Android BuildConfig.
# ==============================================================================
